---
import SubpageLayout from '../../layouts/SubpageLayout.astro';
---

<SubpageLayout title="Health & Medical" description="Hospital access, urgent care and health planning." sectionEmoji="🛠️" sectionLabel="Citizen & Visitor Services" includeTopBar={true} includeFooter={true}>
  <p>Use this page to understand emergency numbers, routine medical planning and what to have ready if you need health support.</p>

  <h2>Checklist</h2>
  <ul>
    <li>Save emergency numbers before you travel</li>
    <li>Carry prescriptions and basic medical info</li>
    <li>Pack essential medicines in your hand luggage</li>
    <li>Know the hospital location and transport plan</li>
  </ul>

  <h2>Urgent care</h2>
  <p>For emergencies, use the appropriate emergency number and get help immediately. Do not delay if the issue is serious.</p>
<h2>Routine care</h2>
  <p>For less urgent matters, contact the hospital or the relevant health office to confirm the right process.</p>
<h2>Travel health prep</h2>
  <p>Visitors should bring regular medication, any required letters and a small first-aid kit for minor issues.</p>

  <h2>Next steps</h2>
  <div class="utility-grid">
    <a href="/directory/">Directory →</a>
    <a href="/contact/">Contact →</a>
    <a href="/visit/transport/">Transport →</a>
    <a href="/news/">Latest updates →</a>
  </div>
</SubpageLayout>

<style>
  .utility-grid{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(2,minmax(0,1fr));gap:16px;margin:1rem 0 2rem}
  .utility-grid a{border:2px solid #1a1a2e;background:#fff;padding:16px;box-shadow:4px 4px 0 #1a1a2e;font-weight:700;display:block}
  @media (max-width: 720px){.utility-grid{grid-template-columns:1fr}}
</style>
